// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  Base URLs
//  • Region prefix (eu./us.) is added by buildServiceUrl() on prod, dev,
//    and sandbox. stage, demo, local → no region prefix.
//  • AUTH_URL never gets a region prefix on any stage.
//  • Local-dev port mappings and the Quasar /<branch>-<service> proxy paths
//    are absorbed by buildServiceUrl(); this block stays a flat table.
//  • WebSocket traffic always lands on a sticky-session host:
//    api-sticky for the main app socket, docnet-sticky for DocNet.
//    Operator chat WS has no sticky variant yet — it rides the regional
//    operator host until backend ships one.
//  • Region is decided once per session from /profile and baked in here
//    at module load. setApiRegion() reloads the page when it changes.
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

